window.products.push({"id":519052,"name":"Retro Countertop Microwave Oven, Large 0.7Cu.ft, 700-Watt, Cold Rolled Steel Countertop with Time Setting, Glass Turntable Plate, Pre-Programmed Cooki","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":129.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yzswg7kTL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Description: This 0.7 Cubic foot 700 watt microwave oven features user-friendly multi-function design to meet your usage needs. 5 power levels and removable turntable in a compact microwave to delivers fast, even cooking and delicious results. The large LED digital display has a time and weight setting function and can also display cooking time remaining. Convenient auto-reminder feature lets you hear beeps after cooking. Its smaller size is ideal for apartment kitchens, vacation homes, offices or dorms. Features: The LED display panel can display the cooking time remaining Enjoy one touch cooking for six of the most popular microwaved foods 360°glass turntable rotates to make food more uniform Equipped with 5 power mode, sound on/off button and child safety lock Child safety lock to prevent unsupervised use by child Automatic alert function with a beep sound after cooking Come with time and weight setting function Cool-touch rounded buttons further improve the user experience Retro design with vibrant color that fits all kitchen styles Specifications: Material: Steel, glass  Dimension: 18\"(L)×14\"(W)×10\"(H) Capacity: 0.7 Cu. Ft (20 L) Output Power: 700 W Rated Voltage: 120 V Frequency: 60 Hz Weight: 23 lbs Package Includes: 1 X Microwave Oven 1 X Manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yzswg7kTL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nightcore","source_asin":"B0854J7G43","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-519052","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0854J7G43","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0854J7G43","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":519053,"name":"8 Pcs Car Door Handle Paint Scratch Protector Sticker Auto Door Handle Scratch Cover Guard Protective Film","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.16,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xCEsVk29L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Specification: Color: Black Material: Carbon Fiber Size: 8.5 x 6.7cm/3.4 x 2.7 inch Quantity: 8 Pcs  Installation: 1.Clean door handle/cup area. Make sure there is no dirt before you apply. 2.Spray water on the cup area, then you can correct timely. 3.Carefully remove the liner behind the film. 4.Stick the film on the door handle just now has been dealt with water. 5.There will be a lot of air bubbles and water under the film.Use a mini squeegee or something flexible to swipe out air bubbles and water. Always move from middle to the edges. 6.When it is raised or wrinkled, heat it with a hot air (low temperature) and smooth it  Package Included: 8 x Car Door Handle Protection Films","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xCEsVk29L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"shunyang","source_asin":"B07RKW4L3Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-519053","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RKW4L3Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RKW4L3Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":519054,"name":"SUNNEST Curtain String Light Christmas, 300 LEDs 9.8FT x 9.8FT String Lights with 8 Lighting Modes, USB Powered Dimmable Hanging Lights with Remote fo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81emEWNdwUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Features: 8 Lighting Effects: fit different decorating themes. Adjustable Brightness: from strong to dim for diverse moods. Timer Function: makes it auto cycle through 6h on and 8h off. Memory Function: remember the settings when you turned off last time. USB Powered: easy to charge and can be used anywhere. 2 Control Options: easy to operate, in case of losing the remote. 300 LEDs: bring bright light, low consumption, saving energy. IP44 Waterproof: makes twinkle lights can stand snow and sprinkle. 9.8FT x 9.8FT: can cover larger areas for better decorating effect.  How to Install Hanging Lights? Step 1: unpack the package, connect to power and test the light effect. If it do not work, please contact us for help. Step 2: find the main string, and hang the hooks on curtain rails. Step 3: untie the 10 individual strings, and let them hang down. Step 4: turn on with remote or USB button, and enjoy gorgeous waterfall lights.  Warm Prompts: 1.Only curtain lights for bedroom, no curtains and no USB charger. 2.IP44 waterproof fairy lights can stand snow and sprinkle, but cannot be used on rainy days. 3.USB connector is not waterproof, so please keep it away from water. 4.Please do not untie the rope of strings until you have fix the main string of indoor string lights in case of tangling.  Specification Material: ABS + copper + epoxy Light Color: blue Waterproof Rate: IP44 Dimension: 9.8FT x 9.8 FT LED Quantity: 300 String Quantity: 10 Weight: 6oz Power Supply: USB plug Power: 5V 1A  Package Included: 1 x LED Curtain Light 1 x Remote Control (13 keys) 10 x Hooks 1 x User Manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81emEWNdwUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SUNNEST","source_asin":"B08FDLGC8C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-519054","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FDLGC8C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FDLGC8C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":519055,"name":"Enesco Trail of Painted Ponies Arabian Nights Figurine 7-Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BbyoAYSTL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Once upon a time in ancient Persia, there was a stunningly beautiful girl who told entrancing stories to her King for a thousand and one adventurous nights! The King was mesmerized by her storytelling and her knowledge of history, philosophy, poetry, and the arts. This young woman was well read and well bred and she entertained and educated the King about morality and kindness, which forever changed the way he ruled. Finally, the King made her his Queen, and to thank her for the many nights of storytelling, he gave his beloved wife a white Arabian Horse, dressed in a classical Arabian Horse Costume featuring intricate patterns, stunning colors and an abundance of tassels. They named their horse \"Arabian Nights.\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BbyoAYSTL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Enesco","source_asin":"B003ACFD2A","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-519055","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003ACFD2A","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003ACFD2A","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
