window.products.push({"id":519250,"name":"Premium Stainless Steel Salt and Pepper Grinder Set of 2 with Anti Slip Sleeve(2 PCs), Salt Mill & Pepper Mill with Adjustable Grinder, Pepper Grinder","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716m3GpY4kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"EASILY ADJUSTABLE CERAMIC GRINDER : Our Salt and Pepper Shakers have a larger heavy duty ceramic rotor. Just twist the knob at the top of each salt and pepper shaker to set your desired coarseness of salt, pepper, or spice. Our salt and pepper mill pair arrive in BRANDED PACKAGING with foam to protect your salt and pepper grinder mills! EASILY ADD SPICES SUCH AS PEPPER AND SALT: When you do have to add spices, the clear glass bodies will let you know when it's time to add it! The stainless steel top easily screws off ,also, it revealing a wide opening for you easily to add spices. MADE OF HIGH QUALITY STAINLESS STEEL, GLASS AND CERAMIC GRINDERS: It will not rust or be easily scratched. And the bottle is made of glass and does not absorb any taste. It can also tell you how much spice is left in the glass. (* Please note that this set contains no salt or pepper.) GLASS BODY PROTECTION: With our silicone cup bottom sleeve, you are not worried that the glass will break easily, and it also makes our grinder look beautiful. Note: the silicone sleeve color is depends on your choice. We provide pink yellow and red gray suits. 365 DAY service: All our salt mills and pepper mills go through rigorous inspection and testing to ensure our customers receive top quality grinder mills. We are confident you will enjoy our refillable spice grinder sets. In the unlikely event that your set is not to your standards, we will replace it for you, or give you your money back, no hassle!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716m3GpY4kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wensince","source_asin":"B08D6TRXKY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-519250","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08D6TRXKY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08D6TRXKY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":519251,"name":"MACVAD Rustic Torched Wood Small Box Sign for Home Decor,Freestanding Thank You Sign for Kitchen,Square Wood Block Sign Table Decor,6\" x 6\" x 1.57\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61CMxPCbGKL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Add a touch of rustic charm to your home with this beautifully crafted small box sign. Made from torched wood, this freestanding thank you sign is the perfect addition to any room in your house. Measuring 6\" x 6\" x 1.57\", this square wood block sign is perfect for displaying on a table, shelf, or any other flat surface. Its compact size makes it easy to move around and decorate different areas of your home. The beautiful torched wood finish adds a warm and welcoming touch to the design, while the \"Thank You\" message in elegant script adds a touch of sophistication to the rustic charm. This small box sign is not only a beautiful piece of home decor, but it's also a great way to express gratitude and appreciation. It makes a thoughtful and meaningful gift for a friend, family member, or anyone you want to thank for their kindness. The freestanding design of this thank you sign makes it easy to display anywhere in your home. Whether you're using it as a centerpiece for your dining table, or simply displaying it on a shelf or mantel, this square wood block sign is sure to add a touch of rustic elegance to your home decor. Overall, this torched wood small box sign is the perfect addition to any home. Its beautiful design, thoughtful message, and versatile freestanding design make it a great way to express gratitude and appreciation, while adding a touch of rustic charm to your home decor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61CMxPCbGKL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MACVAD","source_asin":"B09TQX5FXT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-519251","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TQX5FXT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TQX5FXT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
