window.products.push({"id":519333,"name":"Pavitra Puja Shri Ganpati Ganesh Yantram Good Luck Yantra All Obstacles Remover","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qrHH+Bj2L._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"Mangal Murti Ganesh Yantra Ganesh is the foremost God. He is worshipped first on all auspicious occasions, whether it is a marriage or a religious function. Ganeshji is also invoked and worshipped before any festival, or a new project or venture that a Hindu undertakes. He is the remover of all Vighna (obstacles) and is an extremely benevolent god, fulfilling the wishes of those whom pray to him sincerely. The worshiper of this Yantra is blessed with success in work & business, good luck & new opportunities in career, fulfillment of wishes & desires and achievement of goals & objectives. The one who does Pooja of Ganesh Yantra is blessed with success in his work, business, undertaking & desires. Ganesh Pooja is must before starting any work. It is most auspicious. He is worshipped for siddhi, success in undertakings, and buddhi, intelligence. He is worshipped before any venture is started. He is also the God of education, knowledge and wisdom, literature, and the fine arts. Guru Adi Shankaracharya has recommended that every home should establish Ganesh Yantra on its outer door or wall to get protection from all evils.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qrHH+Bj2L._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pavitra Puja","source_asin":"B0146L4OPA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-519333","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0146L4OPA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0146L4OPA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
