window.products.push({"id":519516,"name":"Softest Queen Flat Sheets Durable, 100% Cotton Sheet, 400 Thread Count Sateen, Smooth Cool, Breathable Best Hotel Quality Top Sheet Only (Lavender Gra","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BW8Oe7YPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WHY‌ ‌CHOOSE‌ ‌100%‌ ‌COTTON‌ ‌OVER‌ ‌MICROFIBER?:‌ ‌‌Microfiber‌ ‌may‌ ‌be‌ ‌cheap‌ ‌but‌ ‌it’s‌ ‌not‌ ‌the‌ ‌best‌ ‌for‌ ‌your‌ ‌health.‌ ‌It’s ‌used‌ ‌to‌ ‌clean‌ ‌glasses,‌ ‌computer‌ ‌screens,‌ ‌etc.‌ ‌because‌ ‌it attracts dust‌ ‌quickly.‌ ‌For‌ ‌healthy‌ ‌sleep,‌ ‌opt‌ ‌for‌ our ‌100%‌ ‌cotton‌ flat sheet ‌that‌ ‌is ‌natural,‌ cool,‌ ‌and‌ ‌breathable—and‌ ‌worth‌ ‌every‌ ‌penny‌ ‌you‌ ‌spend‌ ‌on. SOFT & DURABLE TO LAST A LIFETIME: Our 400 thread count sheet is soft and smooth for a lovely breeze against the skin. Made using long-staple 100% cotton that is grown in India, the fabric is softer than those claiming their sheets to be Egyptian cotton. These flat sheets queen size are exceptionally strong & durable—and last for years to come. WHAT COMES IN THE PACK: Set includes 1 lavender grey queen flat sheet only measuring 90\" W x 102\" L. It has a detailed single pleat hem to bring a stylish addition to your bedding. Pair our flat bed sheets with the duvet cover, fitted sheet, and pillowcases to complete the ensemble. NO HARMFUL SUBSTANCES & EASY TO MAINTAIN: It’s easy to take care of our flat sheets only queen size. Toss them in a machine for a quick wash. These queen size flat sheets become softer with every rinse—and do not shrink, pill, and fade. They are independently tested and certified as STANDARD 100 by OEKO-TEX to be free from harmful chemicals. HASSLE-FREE RETURN/REFUND POLICY: In case you have a problem with our flat top sheets, you can return them for a full refund within 30 days as per Amazon guidelines. Go to your order history and click on return/refund or select ‘contact seller’ option to get in touch with us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BW8Oe7YPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"California Design Den","source_asin":"B07PV66ZZK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-519516","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PV66ZZK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PV66ZZK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
