window.products.push({"id":519679,"name":"[ 49 COUNT ] Extra Large Strong Clear Resealable Zipper Food Storage Bags, 3.5 Gallon BIG Size, 16\"x18\", 2 MILL - Great for Freezer or Storage Organiz","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.15,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617FtqxaqiL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"So Many Uses, Just what you need ! Stock up on our bundle of 49 Large Bags and see how they just come in handy all the time! Perfect for storing food , clothing, toys, papers, magazines , scrap booking, supplies & what not. Keep a pack at home, in the office, and even in the car - You will be glad you did! Our Large 3.5 gallon storage bags are 2 mill. thick, clear, great for food & freezer, marinading roasts & various storage organization needs. Perfect to pack up your belongings when traveling - to organize your suitcase , school stuff, gifts, or your personal belongings when going to the pool, beach or vacation. OFFICE USE - use it to file important papers, documents, files & magazines, arts, photos, samples, catalogs or books. Using these disposable bags helps you to store and actually see what the item is, perfect for storing and freezing all types of food, medications, and supplements for traveling. The secure closure helps keep food fresh and reseals for convenience.  Reclosable resealable Bags for many different purposes and very suitable for the storage of food, dried goods, candy, tea, jewelry, and so on.  Thick plastic & good closure design, works well to keep your wet swimwear, shoes, bath towels & belongings separate & is suitable for taking on the go and transport. Always double bag to ensure complete dryness. Ideal to keep the freshness for a variety of snacks, dog food, fruits, bread, veggies, crackers, cookies and sandwich etc.  Use in pantry to store pet food, snack bags or treat bags for candy, popcorn, fruit snacks, nuts, pretzel rods, cereal, beef jerky, and more; Ideal for kid snacks, snacks for kids; disposable snack bags can be used to hold your fun party favors, partyware, table decorations & party supplies.  Try it - you'll love the clean look of clutter free space & organization!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617FtqxaqiL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Shiny Select USA","source_asin":"B09JYNWJ3B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-519679","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JYNWJ3B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JYNWJ3B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
