window.products.push({"id":519721,"name":"Mustard Cheese Board","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91RQxtd3hML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This is not our favorite dairy-based joke (our favorite starts with, 'What's the best cheese to hide a horse?') This is the best dairy-based joke we could fit on a cheese board. Shakespeare was always going on about the stuff - well, he mentions it once, a bit, in Henry IV. So what better way to liven up the after-dinner conversation than with a play on words from a play of. words, sandwiched between the cheese and wine. and, if you're still wondering; mascarpone.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91RQxtd3hML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MUSTARD","source_asin":"B00GA4YB0A","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-519721","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00GA4YB0A","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00GA4YB0A","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":519722,"name":"Copco - 5248523 Copco Compact Manual Adjustable Coffee Grinder, 6.5-inches, Aqua","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61K5GDc4UqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Roasted coffee beans are little flavor pods, protecting the tasty oils and solubles that provide all the great flavor and richness we coffee lovers crave. The Copco Compact Manual Adjustable Coffee Grinder lets you grind just the right amount, immediately before you brew, ensuring that you get the freshest, tastiest cup of coffee possible. Lightweight and portable, this coffee grinder features a manual hand crank that eliminates the loud noise that electric grinders produce. You'll be able to grind your favorite roast quietly in an office cubicle or in your kitchen when your loved ones are fast asleep. A built-in, adjustable grind selector with 5 settings ensures you have precision control over the coarseness of your grinds which ideal for crafting your favorite coffee for pour over, drip, chemex, cold brew, French press, percolator, AeroPress, Turkish, espresso, reusable K-Cups and more. The bottom portion of the grinder is built to catch the grinds within the canister - simply twist the bottom of the grinder to detach the cup to expose the grinds. The exterior is crafted from stainless steel and plastic, while the interior grinding mechanism consists of ceramic burrs, which are more durable than stainless steel burrs. Small and compact in size, this coffee mill is easy to store in a cabinet or drawer when not in use. It also portable for travel, so you can brew freshly roasted ground coffee beans on your next camping, hiking, backpacking, or outdoors trip. Hand wash only..","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61K5GDc4UqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Copco","source_asin":"B07MVTW1YK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-519722","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MVTW1YK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MVTW1YK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
