window.products.push({"id":519809,"name":"20PACK Long Life Fiberglass Replacement Wicks for Tiki Torch, Candle Wine Bottle Wicks, (0.5\"X9.85\" )Patio Torch Lights Oil Lamp Kit for Outdoor Lante","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.01,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OwYkF91ZS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Package of 20 pcs Replacement Fiberglass Tiki Wick, Length: 9.85 Inch, Diameter: 1/2 Inch, Super value pack with unbeatable factory pricing. Fiberglass replacement wicks torch replacement wick oil lamps wicks candle wine bottles wicks lanterns garden lights wicks for indoor outdoor lighting decor. ✿Features 1. Our Fiberglass Wicks Are Well Woven, Can Be Trimmed. Wicking oil to the flame but never burning the wick itself. 2. Unlike replacement cotton wicks, our fiberglass wicks will last indefinitely with normal use, saving you money and time in the long run. 3. Long-lasting - Burn for hours before they need to be refueled. Excellent burn stability outdoors. Even if there is a strong wind, it will not go out. 4. WON'T SPLIT AFTER YOU CUT IT/POUR OIL, Just unpack and use! ✿Widely Used 1. Fits Most Bamboo, Metal Torches, Wine & Beer bottle Tiki torches, DIY Oil lamps, Candle Rocks, Outdoor Patio Tiki torches, Designer Oil Lamps. 2. These long-life fiberglass replacement wicks fit for homemade wine torches and Outdoor Lighting Torches to make a perfect backyard project providing a long-lasting wick with minimal smoke. ✿How to Use 1. For better results, it is important that a new wick is allowed to absorb the torch oil for approximately 20 minutes before first use. 2. Fiberglass wicks are not consumed during use. You will find wick replacement necessary when switching between paraffin oil, torch fuel or kerosene. 3. The fiberglass wick should be exposed just enough to provide a smooth and steady flame shape, your wick should extend approximately 1/4 inch to 1/2 inch from the torch. ✿NO SMOKE & NO BAD SMELL USING A RIGHT OIL. No odor, Low fuzz. No harm to human body.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OwYkF91ZS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JSYDF","source_asin":"B092SCQ6TT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-519809","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092SCQ6TT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092SCQ6TT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
