window.products.push({"id":519894,"name":"Beasea Dinosaur Soap Mold, 2 Pack Jello 3D Silicone Mat Mini Chocolate Cake Fondant Candy Cookie Baking Making Clay Ice DIY Hard Resin Gummy Cube Tray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61m5MF3kPiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Dino Molds in Cute Shapes for Making Crayons --- The 2pcs adorable decorating jelly moulds, for each mat there’re 6 dinosaurs shaped cavities. For the mat, it’s about 11.3”x8.4”, 1.4” depth for each mini shape. For the other mat, it’s about 10.9”x6.6”, 1.0” depth for each cavity. With nice figures, they are defined and suitable for making nice crayons. Easy to Use Easy to Clean --- Both the 2 set silicone mats are soft and nonstick so it’s easy to unmold what you shaped from them. Easy to pop out, easy to clean after using them. These silicon mold supplies are in moderate size, thicker than normal mats, with good details and sturdy material, are perfect for making anything that need to be shaped, such as bath bombs, soap, mini cupcakes, chocolate, paintful toys for kids, etc. Perfect Craft Molds for Kids DIY --- These durable silicone trays kit can do work great to bring creativity and happiness for kids. With sweet shapes and generous sizes, they are easy to work with these moulds, so can easily occupy the kids and everyone can have fun. Not only to make homemade soaps or crayons conventionally, but also can use them in different ways, such as to make plaster figurines, cement rocks to decorate desks, they all can come out easilly. Petty to Give as Gifts --- The lovely cute designed well made silicone cavity mats are great for homemade DIY gifts. No matter for gift soaps, crayons, wax candles, cakes, jelly candy, etc, they are nice and big but fit in the palm of your hand beautifully. Which can be a great gift for all ages. Work Well with Handmade Baking --- The nice stuff not only be used to make soaps or crayons, but can aslo bake well. As they are non stick, it’s easy to get cakes out of mounds and with clear patterns. If you don’t like to bake, you can also use these molds to make no-bake cookies or ice cubes. Just put the mixture in the molds, stick them in the freezer and they pop out pretty easily. Cute designs so it can easily get small toddler likes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61m5MF3kPiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beasea","source_asin":"B0B129QW4V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-519894","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B129QW4V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B129QW4V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
