window.products.push({"id":519900,"name":"King Fitted Bed Sheets & Pillow Cover Set 100% Organic Cotton 300 TC Fits Mattress Upto 17 Inches Deep Pocket Hotel Quality Luxury Soft Bedding Sheets","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WT8r9aL2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅100% ORGANIC MANUFACTURE: 100% Organic Cotton procured directly from farmers to make these beautiful Sheet Sets in-house. This 300 Thread Count Sheet is made using Percale Weave, which gives the Sheets and PillowCases soft and silky Attributes. ✅BRING HOME THE PURITY OF ORGANIC: Swastha in the ancient Sanskrit language means PURE & Swastha Linen brings to you the PUREST 100% Certified Organic Cotton Sheet set. This King Size set includes 1 Flat sheet (110\" X 102\"), 1 Fitted Sheet (78\" X 80\" +17\") with a deep pocket to fit mattresses up to 17\" and 2 Pillowcases (20\" X 40\"). This product is shipped to you in an environmentally friendly gift pack. ✅EASY TO CARE: Machine Wash Warm Separately or with Like Colors. Use Non - Chlorine Bleach When Needed, Tumble Dry on Low Heat Remove Promptly To Avoid Wrinkles. ✅IN-HOUSE QUALITY ASSURANCE : Our entire production unit, cotton fields, supply chain, employee working conditions are put to a rigorous testing periodically. We are proud to be GOTS Certified (A must have certification for any Organic Product), OEKO Tex, BCI certified (We ensure a fair price to the farmers , adequate wages for workers, industry standard labor practices and community engagements). ✅A PRODUCT FOR EVERY OCCASION : This Sheet Set is a great gifting choice for all your special occasions – Thanksgiving, Christmas, Birthdays, Weddings, and Anniversaries. More than any occasions, it is the best gift you can give to yourself, your family and to everyone whom you want to make a part of organic ecosystem ! Happy Buying!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WT8r9aL2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SW SWASTHA LINEN","source_asin":"B0BR11FC57","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-519900","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BR11FC57","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BR11FC57","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
